@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@tournamentId = 1
@matchId = 1
@playerId = 4
@arenaId = 4gJWpSEN

### ============================================================
### 1. Autentimine
### Käivita enne kõiki kaitstud päringuid. Token salvestatakse
### automaatselt nime järgi: {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Registreerimine (avalik nick on kohustuslik)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testplayer",
  "displayName": "Testija",
  "email": "testplayer@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### 1.2 Sisselogimine: organisaator
# @name organizerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "organizer",
  "password": "Organizer123!"
}

### 1.3 Sisselogimine: mängija
# @name playerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "player1",
  "password": "Player123!"
}

### 1.4 Sisselogimine: admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 1.5 Sisselogimine: teenusekonto (Worker)
# @name serviceLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "service",
  "password": "Service123!"
}

### 1.6 Kes ma olen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 2. Turniirid
### ============================================================

### 2.1 Nimekiri: otsing, filter, sortimine, lehekülg
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments?search=cup&status=Registration&discipline=CS2&sortBy=participants&page=1&pageSize=10

### 2.2 Nimekiri: kõik male turniirid (sh Lichess rapid arenad)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments?discipline=Chess

### 2.3 Nimekiri: ainult Lichessi arenad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments?format=Arena

### 2.4 Turniiri detailid
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}

### 2.5 Turniiri loomine (Organizer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tallinn CS2 Weekend Cup",
  "game": "CS2",
  "description": "Avatud 1v1 aim-turniir kõigile mängijatele.",
  "format": "SingleElimination",
  "maxPlayers": 8,
  "startDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z"
}

### 2.6 Turniiri muutmine (Organizer, ainult oma turniir)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tallinn CS2 Weekend Cup",
  "game": "CS2",
  "description": "Kiire reedeõhtune turniir.",
  "format": "SingleElimination",
  "status": "Registration",
  "maxPlayers": 8,
  "startDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z"
}

### 2.7 Turniiri kustutamine (Organizer, ainult oma turniir)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 3. Registreerimine ja turniiritabel
### ============================================================

### 3.1 Registreerumine turniirile (Player)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{playerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3.2 Turniiritabeli genereerimine (Organizer), tagastab 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/bracket
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3.3 Elo ümberarvutus ja järgmine voor (Organizer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/ratings/recalculate
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/rounds/next
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3.4 Turniiri käsitsi lõpetamine (Organizer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3.5 Lõppenud voorud (Service, Worker kasutab seda)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/rounds-completed
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceLogin.response.body.token}}

## ============================================================
## 4. Mängude tulemused
### ============================================================

### 4.1 Tulemuse sisestamine (Organizer, ainult oma turniir)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player1Score": 2,
  "player2Score": 1
}

### ============================================================
### 5. Mängijad, Elo ja edetabel
### ============================================================

### 5.1 Avalik profiil (nick, reitingud, võidud)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerId}}

### 5.2 Reitingud kõigis mängudes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerId}}/ratings

### 5.3 Elo ajalugu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerId}}/rating-history

### 5.4 Edetabel mängu järgi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/leaderboard?game=Chess%20(rapid)&page=1&pageSize=10

### 5.5 Edetabel otsinguga
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/leaderboard?game=CS2&search=mari

### ============================================================
### 6. Kasutajate haldus (Admin)
### ============================================================

### 6.1 Kasutajad: otsing, roll, allikas, lehekülg
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?search=mari&role=Player&source=local&sortBy=name&page=1&pageSize=15
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 6.2 Lichessi kasutajad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?source=lichess&sortBy=newest
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 6.3 Rolli muutmine
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{playerId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Organizer"
}

### 6.4 Vigane roll: peab tagastama 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{playerId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Superuser"
}

### ============================================================
### 7. Lichess
### ============================================================

### 7.1 Ühe lõppenud arena import (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/import/lichess/{{arenaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 7.2 Lichessi sünkroonimine (Service, Worker kasutab seda)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/service/lichess/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceLogin.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 8. Vead ja õigused
### ============================================================

### 8.1 Ilma tokenita: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/rounds-completed

### 8.2 Mängija proovib loomist: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{playerLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ebaõnnestuv turniir",
  "game": "CS2",
  "format": "SingleElimination",
  "maxPlayers": 8,
  "startDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z"
}

### 8.3 Olematu turniir: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/999999

### 8.4 Vigased andmed: 400 (paaritu mängijate arv)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paaritu arv",
  "game": "CS2",
  "format": "SingleElimination",
  "maxPlayers": 7,
  "startDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z"
}